<section class="home-arc" id="the-arc">
  <div class="home-arc-inner">
    <div class="home-arc-head">
      <span class="home-arc-eyebrow">The How</span>
      <h2 class="home-arc-title">Three mushrooms. One arc. In this order, on purpose.</h2>
      <div class="home-arc-body">
        <p>We didn&rsquo;t pick these three to win a potency contest. We picked them for the order they sit in.</p>
        <p>We built the arc in three steps &mdash; settle, lift, sharpen &mdash; and chose Reishi, Cordyceps, and Lion&rsquo;s Mane to fill them, in that sequence.</p>
        <p><strong>The order is the product.</strong> Not three ingredients thrown together for a label.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} Sequence only — no per-mushroom effect icons/badges, per spec. {%- endcomment -%}
    <ol class="home-arc-steps">
      <li class="home-arc-step">
        <span class="home-arc-num">1</span>
        <span class="home-arc-word">Settle</span>
        <span class="home-arc-shroom">Reishi</span>
      </li>
      <li class="home-arc-step">
        <span class="home-arc-num">2</span>
        <span class="home-arc-word">Lift</span>
        <span class="home-arc-shroom">Cordyceps</span>
      </li>
      <li class="home-arc-step">
        <span class="home-arc-num">3</span>
        <span class="home-arc-word">Sharpen</span>
        <span class="home-arc-shroom">Lion&rsquo;s Mane</span>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <p class="home-arc-close">Calm, energy, clarity &mdash; one arc, designed to work together.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .home-arc { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #F7FBF9 0%, #EEF6F1 100%); padding: clamp(56px, 8vw, 96px) 22px; }
  .home-arc-inner { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .home-arc-head { text-align: center; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto 48px; }
  .home-arc-eyebrow {
    display: inline-block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--green, #2D6A4F); margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .home-arc-title {
    font-size: clamp(27px, 4.2vw, 42px); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.14; color: var(--ink, #16181B); margin: 0 0 22px;
  }
  .home-arc-body p { font-size: clamp(16px, 1.6vw, 18px); line-height: 1.7; color: #40474A; margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .home-arc-body strong { color: var(--ink, #16181B); font-weight: 800; }

  .home-arc-steps {
    list-style: none; margin: 0 0 40px; padding: 0;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 0; position: relative;
  }
  /* the connecting arc line */
  .home-arc-steps::before {
    content: ""; position: absolute; top: 26px; left: 16%; right: 16%; height: 3px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--green-mid, #52B788) 0 14px, transparent 14px 24px);
    z-index: 0;
  }
  .home-arc-step { position: relative; z-index: 1; text-align: center; padding: 0 10px; }
  .home-arc-num {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    width: 54px; height: 54px; margin: 0 auto 16px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--green, #2D6A4F); color: #fff; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 900;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(45,106,79,0.28); border: 4px solid #EEF6F1;
  }
  .home-arc-word { display: block; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 900; color: var(--ink, #16181B); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .home-arc-shroom { display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--green, #2D6A4F); }

  .home-arc-close {
    text-align: center; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto;
    font-size: clamp(17px, 2vw, 21px); font-weight: 800; color: var(--ink, #16181B); line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .home-arc-steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 22px; }
    .home-arc-steps::before { display: none; }
    .home-arc-step { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; text-align: left; }
    .home-arc-num { margin: 0; flex-shrink: 0; }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Home — The Arc",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
